        <div class="row">
            <main id="maincontent" class="grid-17 prepend-1 content larger" role="main">
                <div class="content-inner default-with-sidebar" >
                        <h1>For the Public</h1>
                    


<div class="o-content c-content "  
      >
    <div class="c-html-text__container" >
        <h2>Orphans&#39; Court</h2>

<p>The Orphans Court provides forms for auditing and administration, guardianship, Abortion Control Act, Register of Wills, model forms of account and foreign adoption. <a href="/page/1598" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_self">Access Register of Wills and Orphans&#39; Court forms</a>.</p>

    </div>
